n                                   August 31, 2027                                                NaN\n                                                   NaN                                               NaN                                                NaN\n                                      SOURCES OF FUNDS                                            Amount                                         % of Total\nSenior Construction Loan (Pinnacle Savings Bank, N.A.)                                       $47,500,000                                             83.77%\n     Mezzanine Loan (Brightleaf Mezzanine Capital LLC)                                        $9,200,000                                             16.23%\n                                  Borrower Cash Equity                                                $0                                              0.00%\n                                         Total Sources                                       $56,700,000                                            100.00%\n                                                   NaN                                               NaN                                                NaN\n                                         USES OF FUNDS                                            Amount                                         % of Total\n                  Land Acquisition (previously closed)                                        $8,200,000                                             14.46%\n                         Hard Construction Costs (GMP)                                       $34,750,000                                             61.29%\n                                            Soft Costs                                        $4,150,000                                              7.32%\n                                      Interest Reserve                                        $4,850,000                                              8.55%\n                          Loan Origination Fee (1.00%)                                          $475,000                                              0.84%\n                                 Developer Fee (5.00%)                                        $2,835,000                                              5.00%\n                                           Contingency                                        $1,440,000                                              2.54%\n                                            Total Uses                                       $56,700,000                                            100.00%\n                                                   NaN                                               NaN                                                NaN\n                                 KEY FINANCIAL METRICS                                               NaN                                                NaN\n                                   Total Project Costs                                       $56,700,000                                                NaN\n                                    Senior Loan Amount                                       $47,500,000                                                NaN\n      Loan-to-Cost (Senior Loan / Total Project Costs)                                            83.77%                     EXCEEDS 80% MAX PER TERM SHEET\n                Maximum Permitted LTC (per Term Sheet)                                            80.00%                                                NaN\n                        Maximum Senior Loan at 80% LTC                                       $45,360,000                                                NaN\n                         LTC Excess / Equity Shortfall                                        $2,140,000                                                NaN\n                          As-Completed Appraised Value                                       $72,800,000 Per Ridgeline Appraisal