ngs · 2.17 Loan Account\n\nARTICLE III — CONDITIONS PRECEDENT TO CLOSING\n3.1 Loan Documents · 3.2 Entity and Authorization Matters · 3.3 Financial Conditions; Equity\nDeposit · 3.4 Third-Party Reports · 3.5 Title, Survey and Zoning · 3.6 Environmental Conditions ·\n3.7 Construction Documents · 3.8 Insurance · 3.9 Payoff of Existing Indebtedness · 3.10\nIntercreditor Agreement · 3.11 Legal Opinions · 3.12 Fees and Expenses · 3.13 No Default; No\nMaterial Adverse Effect · 3.14 Prior Liens and Work · 3.15 Waiver\n\nARTICLE IV — ADVANCES\n4.1 Advances Generally · 4.2 Conditions to Each Advance · 4.3 Hard Cost Advances and\nRetainage · 4.4 The Final Advance · 4.5 Soft Cost Advances · 4.6 Funding of the Interest Reserve\n· 4.7 Approved Budget; Contingency; Cost Overruns · 4.8 Equity First · 4.9 Lien Waivers · 4.10\nTitle Date-Down · 4.11 Construction Consultant · 4.12 Change Orders · 4.13 Suspension and\nTermination of Advances · 4.14 No Obligation to Inspect · 4.15 Reaffirmation · 4.16 Use of\nProceeds; Prohibited Distributions\n\nARTICLE V — REPRESENTATIONS AND WARRANTIES\n5.1 Organization; Authority · 5.2 Enforceability · 5.3 Capital Structure; Members · 5.4 Title; Liens\n\nSTDERR:\nCould not write image to img/p-01.jpg; exiting\n", "tool_call_id": "call_00_DTZ4qo1ITIfeXWOSukYq5918", "tool_name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\": \"cd $WORKSPACE_DIR/work && pdftoppm -jpeg -r 70 -f 1 -l 6 pdf/la_formatted.pdf img/p && ls img && python3 -c \\\"\\nimport subprocess\\n\\\" ; pdftotext -f 1 -l 3 pdf/la_formatted.pdf - | head -60\"}"}
