{"turn": 52, "role": "tool", "result": "Loan Agreement — The Piedmont at Brightleaf — Loan No. CRE-2025-0342\n\n1.3 Accounting Terms. All accounting terms not otherwise defined have the\nmeanings given to them under GAAP. If any change in GAAP after the date hereof\nwould affect the computation of any financial covenant, Borrower and Lender shall\nnegotiate in good faith an amendment to preserve the original intent; pending such\namendment, the covenant shall be computed on the basis of GAAP in effect on the\nClosing Date.\n1.4 Rounding. Any financial ratio or percentage shall be rounded to the nearest\none-hundredth of one percent (0.01%) and dollars to the nearest whole dollar.\n\nDraft No. 1 — February 3, 2025 — Privileged & Confidential — Not for Execution\n\nPage 14 of 75\n\n\fLoan Agreement — The Piedmont at Brightleaf — Loan No. CRE-2025-0342\n\nARTICLE II — THE LOAN\n2.1 The Commitment; Maximum Outstanding Amount.\n(a) Subject to the terms and conditions of this Agreement, Lender agrees to\nmake Advances to Borrower from time to time in an aggregate principal\namount not to exceed the Commitment.\n(b) Borrowing Base Limitation. Notwithstanding the Commitment, in no\nevent shall the aggregate outstanding principal balance of the Loan at any\ntime exceed the lesser of (i) the Commitment and (ii) an amount equal to\neighty percent (80%) of Total Project Costs (the “LTC Availability”), it being\nacknowledged that, based on Total Project Costs of $56,700,000 as of the\nClosing Date and the Equity Deposit of $2,140,000 required by Section 4.8,\nthe LTC Availability would be $45,360,000 and the Loan would accordingly\nbe advanced in the maximum aggregate principal amount of $45,360,000\nunless Total Project Costs are increased (whether by Change Orders, Cost\nOverruns or otherwise) and approved by Lender in accordance with Section\n4.7. The amount of the Commitment not advanced as a result of this\nlimitation shall remain available for Advance if, when and to the extent Total\nProject Costs increase as permitted by this Agreement.\n(c) The Loan is a multiple-disbursement facility. Nothing in the Term Sheet’s\nreference to a “single advance facility” shall be construed to require a single\ndisbursement of the Loan proceeds; Advances shall be made in accordance\nwith the Approved Draw Schedule and Article IV.\n2.2 Purpose and Use of Proceeds. The proceeds of the Loan shall be used solely\n", "tool_call_id": "call_00_JauIw1Ti2HPjaTaGAEEN7636", "tool_name": "bash", "arguments": "{\"command\": \"cd $WORKSPACE_DIR/work && pdftotext -f 14 -l 15 pdf/la_formatted.pdf - | head -40\"}"}
